    "Entre 0 y 23. Recomendado: 4–6 hs para restaurantes con cierre tardío.": ["Between 0 and 23. Recommended: 4–6 for restaurants that close late.", "Mellem 0 og 23. Anbefalet: 4–6 for restauranter, der lukker sent."],
